<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50</p>
<p>lower. Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 0.25-0.50 lower. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    44.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    45.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    47.50-48.50</p>
</text>
